msgid "&Session time:"
msgstr "Vrijeme &sesije:"

#: edittaskdialog.cpp:106
msgid "Edit &relative (apply to both time and session time)"
msgstr "Izmijeni &relativno (primjenjuje se i na vrijeme i na vrijeme sesije)"

#: edittaskdialog.cpp:145
msgid "A&uto tracking"
msgstr "A&utomatsko praćenje"

#: edittaskdialog.cpp:154
msgid "In Desktop"
msgstr "Na desktopu"

#: edittaskdialog.cpp:216
msgid "Enter the name of the task here. This name is for your eyes only."
msgstr "Unesite ovdje ime zadatka. Ovo ime je samo za vaše oči."

#: edittaskdialog.cpp:219
msgid ""
"If you select this radio button, you specify that you want to enter the time "
"as absolute values. For example: the time for this task is 20 hours and 15 "
"minutes.\n"
"\n"
"The time is specified for the cumulated time and the session time separately."
msgstr ""
"Izborom ovog radio dugmeta navodite da "
"želite da unesete vrijeme kao apsolutnu "
"vrijednost. Na primjer: vrijeme za ovaj zadatak "
"je 20 sati i 15 minuta.\n"
"\n"
"Vrijeme se posebno navodi za kumulativno "
"vrijeme i za vrijeme sesije."

#: edittaskdialog.cpp:226
msgid ""
"If you select this radio button, you specify that you want to add or "
"subtract time for the task. For example: I've worked 2 hours and 20 minutes "
"more on this task (without having the timer running.)\n"
"\n"
"This time will be added or subtracted for both the session time and the "
"cumulated time."
msgstr ""
"Izborom ovog radio dugmeta navodite da "
"želite da dodate ili oduzmete vrijeme "
"zadatku. Na primjer: Radio sam 2 sata i 20 "
"minuta više na ovom zadatku (dok sat nije radio).\n"
"\n"
"Ovo vrijeme će biti dodato ili oduzeto i od "
"vremena sesije i od kumulativnog vremena."

#: edittaskdialog.cpp:233
msgid "This is the overall time this task has been running."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je ukupno vrijeme tokom kojeg je ovaj "
"zadatak radio."

#: edittaskdialog.cpp:236
msgid "This is the time the task has been running this session."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je vrijeme tokom kojeg je zadatak radio "
"u ovoj sesiji."

#: edittaskdialog.cpp:238
msgid "Specify how much time to add or subtract to the overall and session time"
msgstr ""
"Navedite koliko vremena treba da se doda "
"ili oduzme od ukupnog vremena i vremena za sesiju."

